a-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;1198&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Kích thước pixel&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;1.12 µm × 1.12 µm&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1273&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1259&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Giao tiếp dữ liệu&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;1259&quot; data-end=&quot;1273&quot;&gt;MIPI CSI-2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;1274&quot; data-end=&quot;1312&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;1274&quot; data-end=&quot;1296&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Số lane thường dùng&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;1296&quot; data-end=&quot;1312&quot;&gt;2-lane CSI-2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;1313&quot; data-end=&quot;1343&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;1313&quot; data-end=&quot;1330&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Dữ liệu output&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;1330&quot; data-end=&quot;1343&quot;&gt;RAW Bayer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;1344&quot; data-end=&quot;1395&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;1344&quot; data-end=&quot;1362&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Module phổ biến&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;1362&quot; data-end=&quot;1395&quot;&gt;Raspberry Pi Camera Module v2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1397&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;Tài liệu module của Raspberry Pi Camera v2 ghi camera có thể chụp ảnh &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1467&quot; data-end=&quot;1482&quot;&gt;3280 × 2464&lt;/strong&gt; và video &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1492&quot; data-end=&quot;1523&quot;&gt;1080p30, 720p60, 640×480p90&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Arducam cũng liệt kê IMX219 là cảm biến 8MP, Type 1/4 inch, pixel size 1.12 µm và CSI-2 2-lane. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1701&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;ckx2yc&quot; data-start=&quot;1703&quot; data-end=&quot;1736&quot;&gt;3. IMX219 xuất ra ảnh kiểu gì?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1738&quot; data-end=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;IMX219 thường xuất dữ liệu dạng &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1770&quot; data-end=&quot;1783&quot;&gt;RAW Bayer&lt;/strong&gt;, không phải RGB hoàn chỉnh.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1813&quot; data-end=&quot;1833&quot;&gt;Ví dụ pattern Bayer:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1835&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;R G R G R G&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;G B G B G 