iv&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2586&quot; data-end=&quot;2601&quot;&gt;Sơ đồ đơn giản:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2603&quot; data-end=&quot;2743&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU / SoC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  │ I2C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219 registers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  │ MIPI CSI-2 RAW data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI Receiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAM / Display / Encoder / AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1wyg8gd&quot; data-start=&quot;2745&quot; data-end=&quot;2768&quot;&gt;I2C dùng để làm gì?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2770&quot; data-end=&quot;2809&quot;&gt;CPU dùng I2C để cấu hình sensor, ví dụ:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2811&quot; data-end=&quot;2973&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Bật/tắt streaming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Chọn độ phân giải&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Chọn frame rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Set exposure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Set analog gain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Set digital gain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Cấu hình crop/window&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Cấu hình timing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;me48j2&quot; data-start=&quot;2975&quot; data-end=&quot;3005&quot;&gt;MIPI CSI-2 dùng để làm gì?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3007&quot; data-end=&quot;3303&quot;&gt;MIPI CSI-2 dùng để truyền dữ liệu ảnh từ sensor về SoC. Đây là giao tiếp phổ biến cho camera embedded; MIPI Alliance mô tả CSI-2 là giao tiếp camera embedded được triển khai rất rộng rãi, hỗ trợ từ camera độ phân giải thấp đến video 1080p, 4K, 8K và hơn nữa. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3305&quot; data-end=&quot;3308&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1ygvybb&quot; data-start=&quot;3310&quot; data-end=&quot;3355&quot;&gt;5. IMX219 nằm ở đâu trong camera pipeline?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3357&quot; data-end=&quot;3421&quot;&gt;Trong một hệ thống SoC có ISP, IMX219 thường nằm ở đầu pipeline:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3423&quot; data-end=&quot;3907&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;|   Lens      |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;       ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;|   IMX219    |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;| CMOS Sensor |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;       │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;       │ MIPI CSI-2 RAW Bayer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;       ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;| CSI-2 RX    |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;       ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;|    ISP      |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;       ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;| DDR Memory  |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;       ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+-------------+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;| Display     | Video Encode | AI / NPU    |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+-------------+-------------+-------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3909&quot; data-end=&quot;4034&quot;&gt;CPU không đọc từng pixel trực tiếp từ IMX219 qua I2C. I2C quá chậm, chỉ dùng để cấu hình. Dữ liệu ảnh thật đi qua MIPI CSI-2.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4036&quot; data-end=&quot;4039&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;vpdiuo&quot; data-start=&quot;4041&quot; data-end=&quot;4079&quot;&gt;6. IMX219 và ISP liên quan thế nào?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4081&quot; data-end=&quot;4156&quot;&gt;IMX219 tạo ra dữ liệu ảnh thô. ISP biến dữ liệu thô đó thành ảnh dùng được.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4158&quot; data-end=&quot;4184&quot;&gt;Ví dụ IMX219 gửi ra RAW10:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4186&quot; data-end=&quot;4229&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219 output:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAW10 Bayer data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/