class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;I2C        → cấu hình IMX219&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;MIPI CSI-2 → truyền pixel từ IMX219&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI4-Lite  → CPU cấu hình ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI4/DMA   → ghi frame vào RAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;8767&quot; data-end=&quot;8770&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;rcs5hw&quot; data-start=&quot;8772&quot; data-end=&quot;8804&quot;&gt;12. IMX219 phù hợp để học gì?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;8806&quot; data-end=&quot;8842&quot;&gt;IMX219 rất phù hợp nếu bạn muốn học:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;8844&quot; data-end=&quot;9072&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Camera sensor hoạt động thế nào&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- MIPI CSI-2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RAW Bayer format&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- ISP pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Linux V4L2 camera driver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Device Tree cho camera&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Embedded AI camera input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Jetson/Raspberry Pi camera stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- FPGA camera capture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9074&quot; data-end=&quot;9251&quot;&gt;Nếu mục tiêu của bạn là thiết kế hệ thống Edge AI có Camera + ISP + NPU, thì IMX219 là một cảm biến tốt để học vì nó đủ đơn giản, phổ biến và có nhiều tài liệu/module tham khảo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;9253&quot; data-end=&quot;9256&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1wtpw37&quot; data-start=&quot;9258&quot; data-end=&quot;9278&quot;&gt;Kết luận ngắn gọn&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9280&quot; data-end=&quot;9545&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;9280&quot; data-end=&quot;9297&quot;&gt;IMX219 Camera&lt;/strong&gt; là module camera dùng cảm biến Sony IMX219 8MP. Nó thu ánh sáng qua lens, tạo dữ liệu &lt;strong data-start=&quot;9384&quot; data-end=&quot;9397&quot;&gt;RAW Bayer&lt;/strong&gt;, rồi truyền về SoC qua &lt;strong data-start=&quot;9421&quot; data-end=&quot;9435&quot;&gt;MIPI CSI-2&lt;/strong&gt;. CPU cấu hình sensor thông qua &lt;strong data-start=&quot;9467&quot; data-end=&quot;9474&quot;&gt;I2C&lt;/strong&gt;, còn việc biến RAW thành ảnh đẹp thường do &lt;strong data-start=&quot;9518&quot; data-end=&quot;9525&quot;&gt;ISP&lt;/strong&gt; trong SoC đảm nhận.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9547&quot; data-end=&quot;9555&quot;&gt;Tóm tắt:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;9557&quot; data-end=&quot;9752&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219 = camera sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;I2C = đường cấu hình sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;MIPI CSI-2 = đường truyền dữ liệu ảnh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP = xử lý RAW thành RGB/YUV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI/DMA = ghi frame vào RAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU/NPU = dùng frame cho app hoặc AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="&#xa;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;378380a6-bcfa-46e0-8834-f9b730587fca&quot; data-is-intersecting=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-(--header-height)&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;378380a6-bcfa-46e0-8834-f9b730587fca&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;378380a6-bcfa-46e0-8834-f9b730587fca&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-3&quot; data-scroll-anchor=&quot;false&quot; data-turn=&quot;user&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;user&quot; data-message-id=&q