e&gt;&lt;span&gt;Camera Link HS / CoaXPress&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;13543&quot; data-end=&quot;13546&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;cilmjb&quot; data-start=&quot;13548&quot; data-end=&quot;13571&quot;&gt;18. Kết luận ngắn gọn&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;13573&quot; data-end=&quot;13757&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;13573&quot; data-end=&quot;13757&quot;&gt;MIPI CSI-2 được dùng nhiều trong camera ISP vì nó là chuẩn rất phù hợp để truyền dữ liệu RAW tốc độ cao từ camera sensor vào SoC/ISP với ít chân, điện năng thấp và độ phổ biến cao.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;13759&quot; data-end=&quot;13777&quot;&gt;Nên nhớ sơ đồ này:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;13779&quot; data-end=&quot;13970&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;I2C        = cấu hình sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;MIPI CSI-2 = truyền pixel từ sensor vào SoC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP        = xử lý RAW thành RGB/YUV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI4-Lite  = CPU cấu hình ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI4/DMA   = ghi frame đã xử lý vào RAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;13972&quot; data-end=&quot;14328&quot;&gt;Nếu học thiết kế hệ thống camera embedded/Edge AI, bạn nên xem &lt;strong data-start=&quot;14035&quot; data-end=&quot;14049&quot;&gt;MIPI CSI-2&lt;/strong&gt; là chuẩn chính để nối camera sensor với SoC/ISP. Các chuẩn như &lt;strong data-start=&quot;14113&quot; data-end=&quot;14175&quot;&gt;GMSL, FPD-Link, A-PHY, USB3 Vision, GigE Vision, CoaXPress&lt;/strong&gt; không hẳn “thay thế trực tiếp”, mà phục vụ các bài toán khác nhau: dây dài, automotive, industrial camera, PC machine vision hoặc high-speed inspection.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;mt-3 w-full empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" link="&#xa;&lt;div class=&quot;qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-2&quot; data-is-intersecting=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-2&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-2&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-6&quot; data-scroll-anchor=&quot;false&quot; data-turn=&quot;assistant&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;759fab36-e0ed-4b9c-9f56-11ccf3a28ec2&quot; data-turn-start-message=&quot;true&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;ycujzt&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;23&quot;&gt;1. MIPI CSI-2 là gì?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;25&quot; data-end=&quot;72&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;25&quot; data-end=&quot;72&quot;&gt;MIPI CSI-2 = MIPI Camera Serial Interface 2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;74&quot; data-end=&quot;205&quot;&gt;Đây là chuẩn giao tiếp tốc độ cao dùng để truyền dữ liệu ảnh/video từ &lt;strong data-start=&quot;144&quot; data-end=&quot;161&quot;&gt;camera sensor&lt;/strong&gt; sang &lt;strong data-start=&quot;167&quot; data-end=&quot;204&quot;&gt;application processor / SoC / ISP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;207&quot; data-end=&quot;258&quot;&gt;Trong hệ embedded camera, nó thường nằm ở đoạn này:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;389&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lens&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Camera Sensor, ví dụ IMX219&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;MIPI CSI-2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI-2 Receiver trong SoC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;DDR / Display / Encoder / NPU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;391&quot; data-end=&quot;589&quot;&gt;MIPI Alliance mô tả CSI-2 là giao tiếp camera embedded được triển khai rất rộng rãi, dùng cho nhiều mức ứng dụng từ 1080p, 4K, 8K đến chụp ảnh độ phân giải cao. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;591&quot; data-end=&quot;604&quot;&gt;Nói ngắn gọn:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;606&quot; data-end=&quot;689&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;MIPI CSI-2 = đường truyền dữ liệu ảnh tốc độ cao từ sensor vào SoC/ISP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;691&quot; data-end=&quot;694&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1u61298&quot; data-start=&quot;696&quot; data-end=&quot;735&quot;&gt;2. Vì sao camera/ISP cần MIPI CSI-2?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;737&quot; data-end=&quot;780&quot;&gt;Camera sensor tạo ra lượng dữ liệu rất lớn.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;818&quot;&gt;Ví dụ ảnh 1920 × 1080 RAW10, 30 fps:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;820&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;1920 × 1080 × 10 bit × 30 fps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;≈ 622 Mbps dữ liệu pixel thô&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;892&quot; data-end=&quot;986&quot;&gt;Đó mới chỉ là 1080p30. Nếu lên 4K, 8MP, 60 fps hoặc nhiều camera thì băng thông tăng rất mạnh.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;988&quot; data-end=&quot;1036&quot;&gt;Vì vậy camera cần một giao tiếp có các đặc điểm:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Tốc độ cao&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Ít chân tín hiệu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Tiêu thụ điện thấp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Phù hợp truyền dữ liệu liên tục&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Hỗ trợ nhiều format RAW/YUV/RGB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Phù hợp chip nhỏ như điện thoại, SBC, SoC AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1270&quot;&gt;MIPI CSI-2 sinh ra để giải quyết đúng bài toán này.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1272&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;16fsqrd&quot; data-start=&quot;1277&quot; data-end=&quot;1308&quot;&gt;3. MIPI CSI-2 truyền cái gì?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1347&quot;&gt;CSI-2 thường truyền dữ liệu ảnh dạng:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1349&quot; data-end=&quot;1430&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RAW8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RAW12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RAW14&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RGB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- YUV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Metadata&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Embedded data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1432&quot; data-end=&quot;1511&quot;&gt;Với camera sensor như &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1464&quot;&gt;IMX219&lt;/strong&gt;, dữ liệu thường là &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1484&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;RAW Bayer&lt;/strong&gt;, ví dụ RAW10:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1513&quot; data-end=&quot;1599&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5