rong data-start=&quot;9573&quot; data-end=&quot;9594&quot;&gt;camera thành phẩm&lt;/strong&gt;, không muốn xử lý sensor driver/CSI/ISP sâu.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;9641&quot; data-end=&quot;9644&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;19bl286&quot; data-start=&quot;9646&quot; data-end=&quot;9664&quot;&gt;14. GigE Vision&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9666&quot; data-end=&quot;9729&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;9666&quot; data-end=&quot;9681&quot;&gt;GigE Vision&lt;/strong&gt; là chuẩn camera công nghiệp chạy trên Ethernet.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9731&quot; data-end=&quot;9981&quot;&gt;Automate.org mô tả GigE Vision là chuẩn giao tiếp camera toàn cầu dựa trên Gigabit Ethernet, cho phép truyền ảnh nhanh qua cáp tiêu chuẩn, chiều dài lớn và khả năng tương tác giữa phần cứng/phần mềm nhiều vendor. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;18iolje&quot; data-start=&quot;9983&quot; data-end=&quot;9994&quot;&gt;Ưu điểm&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;9996&quot; data-end=&quot;10156&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq