t;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAW image        → ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Embedded metadata → CPU/RAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Second stream     → another pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Debug dump        → DDR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;11862&quot; data-end=&quot;11924&quot;&gt;Nếu nhét cứng CSI-2 RX vào ISP, hệ thống sẽ kém linh hoạt hơn.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;11926&quot; data-end=&quot;11929&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;n9ms6i&quot; data-start=&quot;11931&quot; data-end=&quot;11976&quot;&gt;Lý do 4: Có thể cần DMA vào RAM để buffer&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;11978&quot; data-end=&quot;12029&quot;&gt;Camera và ISP có thể chạy ở clock domain khác nhau:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;12031&quot; data-end=&quot;12097&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI clock domain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP clock domain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;DDR/AXI clock domain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;12099&quot; data-end=&quot;12121&quot;&gt;Dùng DMA/AXI/DDR giúp:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;12123&quot; data-end=&quot;12277&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Hấp thụ jitter/burst&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Buffer frame&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Đồng bộ clock domain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Cho CPU/NPU/encoder cùng truy cập frame&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Debug dễ hơn vì có thể dump RAW frame&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;12279&quot; data-end=&quot;12551&quot;&gt;TI mô tả một CSI2RX subsystem có các IP riêng: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;12326&quot; data-end=&quot;12342&quot;&gt;Cadence DPHY&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;12344&quot; data-end=&quot;12369&quot;&gt;Cadence CSI2RX bridge&lt;/strong&gt;, và &lt;strong data-start=&quot;12374&quot; data-end=&quot;12399&quot;&gt;TI CSI2RX DMA wrapper&lt;/strong&gt;; nó hỗ trợ capture camera frame qua MIPI CSI-2, nhiều virtual channel, 1–4 lane, và nhiều format như YUV/RGB/RAW. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;12553&quot; data-end=&quot;12697&quot;&gt;Điều này cho thấy trong SoC thật, CSI receiver thường là một subsystem riêng, có bridge/DMA, không đơn giản chỉ là “một phần nhỏ bên trong ISP”.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;12699&quot; data-end=&quot;12702&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;prkjv0&quot; data-start=&quot;12704&quot; data-end=&quot;12758&quot;&gt;Lý do 5: ISP không chỉ nhận dữ liệu từ camera live&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;12760&quot; data-end=&quot;12781&quot;&gt;ISP có thể cần xử lý:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;12783&quot; data-end=&quot;12943&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RAW frame từ sensor live&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RAW frame đã lưu trong DDR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Test pattern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Frame từ bridge HDMI-to-CSI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Frame từ nhiều camera&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Frame replay để debug&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;12945&quot; data-end=&quot;13035&quot;&gt;Nếu ISP chỉ gắn cứng với CSI-2 receiver, bạn mất khả năng dùng ISP cho nguồn dữ liệu khác.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;13037&quot; data-end=&quot;13040&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;c1gk4m&quot; data-start=&quot;13042&quot; data-end=&quot;13072&quot;&gt;10. Vậy AXI ở đây là AXI gì?&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;13074&quot; data-end=&quot;13088&quot;&gt;Cần phân biệt:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;13090&quot; data-end=&quot;13216&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI4-Lite   = CPU cấu hình register&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI4        = đọc/ghi frame trong DDR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI-Stream  = truyền pixel stream nội bộ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;13218&quot; data-end=&quot;13240&quot;&gt;Trong camera pipeline:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;13242&quot; data-end=&quot;13407&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU ──AXI4-Lite──&amp;gt; CSI RX registers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU ──AXI4-Lite──&amp;gt; ISP registers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI RX ──AXI4/DMA──&amp;gt; DDR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP    ──AXI4──────&amp;gt; DDR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;hoặc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI RX ──AXI-Stream──&amp;gt; ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;13409&quot; data-end=&quot;13596&quot;&gt;Không nên hiểu “AXI” chỉ là một loại. Nếu là &lt;strong data-start=&quot;13454&quot; data-end=&quot;13476&quot;&gt;AXI4 memory-mapped&lt;/strong&gt;, thường dùng để ghi frame vào RAM. Nếu là &lt;strong data-start=&quot;13519&quot; data-end=&quot;13533&quot;&gt;AXI-Stream&lt;/strong&gt;, nó có thể là đường pixel stream trực tiếp giữa CSI RX và ISP.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;13598&quot; data-end=&quot;13601&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;tt7ekf&quot; data-start=&quot;13603&quot; data-end=&quot;13642&quot;&gt;11. Tóm tắt theo từng câu hỏi của bạn&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;vhvxaj&quot; data-start=&quot;13644&quot; data-end=&quot;13677&quot;&gt;IMX219 đã có packetizer chưa?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;13679&quot; data-end=&quot;13830&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;13679&quot; data-end=&quot;13686&quot;&gt;Có.&lt;/strong&gt; IMX219 có CSI-2 transmitter bên trong. Nó tự đóng gói RAW Bayer thành CSI-2 packets rồi truyền qua D-PHY. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;y6mzpc&quot; data-start=&quot;13832&quot; data-end=&quot;13869&quot;&gt;Có cần cấu hình packetizer không?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;13871&quot; data-end=&quot;13954&quot;&gt;Bạn không cấu hình packetizer như một IP rời. Bạn cấu hình &lt;strong data-start=&quot;13930&quot; data-end=&quot;13945&quot;&gt;sensor mode&lt;/strong&gt; qua I2C:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;13956&quot; data-end=&quot;14066&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;resolution, RAW8/RAW10, frame rate, exposure, gain, PLL/link frequency, lane config, stream on/off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;14068&quot; data-end=&quot;14177&quot;&gt;Driver IMX219 trong Linux hỗ trợ các control này ở mức sensor driver. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;107oxtu&quot; data-start=&quot;14179&quot; data-end=&quot;14222&quot;&gt;CSI-2 streaming liên tục bằng cách nào?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;14224&quot; data-end=&quot;14390&quot;&gt;Sensor liên tục tạo frame, packetizer tạo FS/long packets/FE, D-PHY truyền HS burst tốc độ cao, receiver decode packet, kiểm tra ECC/CRC, rồi đẩy payload vào ISP/DMA.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1lkjf4b&quot; data-start=&quot;14392&quot; data-end=&quot;14441&quot;&gt;Hai lane cùng truyền thì biết thứ tự thế nào?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;14443&quot; data-end=&quot;14541&quot;&gt;Hai lane không truyền packet độc lập. Packet byte stream được chia xen kẽ theo lane order cố định:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;14543&quot; data-end=&quot;14594&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lane0: B0 B2 B4 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lane1: B1 B3 B5 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;14596&quot; data-end=&quot;14629&quot;&gt;Receiver đồng bộ lane, merge lại:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;14631&quot; data-end=&quot;14661&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;B0 B1 B2 B3 B4 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;14663&quot; data-end=&quot;14685&quot;&gt;rồi mới decode packet.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;esvuju&quot; data-start=&quot;14687&quot; data-end=&quot;14738&quot;&gt;Tại sao không tích hợp CSI-2 RX luôn trong ISP?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;14740&quot; data-end=&quot;14806&quot;&gt;Có thể tích hợp hoặc nối trực tiếp, nhưng nhiều SoC tách riêng vì:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;14808&quot; data-end=&quot;15073&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- CSI-2 RX là interface/protocol/PHY, ISP là image processing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- D-PHY cần nằm gần chân chip&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Cần hỗ trợ nhiều camera, VC, DT, metadata&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Cần DMA/buffer/clock-domain crossing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Muốn ISP xử lý được cả dữ liệu từ DDR hoặc nguồn khác&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Dễ reuse IP và debug&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;15075&quot; data-end=&quot;15106&quot;&gt;Sơ đồ thực tế nên hiểu như sau:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;15108&quot; data-end=&quot;15282&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓ CSI-2 over D-PHY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI-2 RX / D-PHY / packet decoder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ├── AXI-Stream → ISP trực tiếp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ├── AXI4 DMA   → DDR → ISP đọc lại&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  └── Metadata   → DDR/CPU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;15284&quot; data-end=&quot;15293&quot;&gt;Câu chốt:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;15295&quot; data-end=&quot;15495&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219 đã đóng gói CSI-2 sẵn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI-2 receiver có nhiệm vụ bóc gói, ghép lane, kiểm tra lỗi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP không nhất thiết phải chứa CSI-2 RX vì CSI-2 RX là khối giao tiếp, còn ISP là khối xử lý ảnh.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;mt-3 w-full empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;inline-flex border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bg-token-main-surface-tertiary w-px flex-1 self-stretch&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" link="&#xa;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;ab82f3bf-d876-44ce-9440-632b76daa84a&quot; data-is-intersecting=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-(--header-height)&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;ab82f3bf-d876-44ce-9440-632b76daa84a&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;ab82f3bf-d876-44ce-9440-632b76daa84a&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-19&quot; data-scroll-anchor=&quot;false&quot; data-turn=&quot;user&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;user&quot; data-message-id=&quot;ab82f3bf-d876-44ce-9440-632b76daa84a&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex flex-col w-fit max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%) items-start self-end rtl:items-end rtl:self-start&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-custom-highlighting-behavior=&quot;boundary&quot; class=&quot;A_HxFq_root&quot; data-testid=&quot;collapsible-user-message-root&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;_r_1d3_&quot; data-testid=&quot;collapsible-user-message-content&quot; class=&quot;A_HxFq_content&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;max-w-full min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;mudule camera &#39;IMX219&#39; đã tích hợp bộ đóng gói packet(packetizer) để truyền kiểu CSI-2 chưa. Có thể hay có cần cấu hình lại packetizer đó không?&#xa;giải thích cơ chế streaming CSI-2 làm thế nào để CSI-2 đảm bảo các frame được truyền liên tục tốc độ cao trên nhiều lane&#xa;nếu có 2 lane cùng lúc truyền dữ liệu thì cơ chế nào giúp CSI receiver phát hiện thứ tự packet trước sau.&#xa;tại sao không tích hợp CSI-2 Receiver luôn trên ISP mà phải chuyển qua AXI rồi truyền vào ISP&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;z-0 flex justify-end&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-9&quot; data-is-intersecting=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-9&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-9&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-20&quot; data-scroll-anchor=&quot;false&quot; data-turn=&quot;assistant&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;460c1084-a77d-4bf3-a2b3-e196ac5e8837&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;267&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mình sẽ trả lời theo hướng thiết kế hệ thống thật: sensor IMX219 → CSI-2 TX/packetizer → D-PHY lanes → CSI receiver → ISP/VI/DMA. Có vài chỗ dễ nhầm, đặc biệt là “nhiều lane truyền song song” nhưng CSI-2 vẫn giữ thứ tự byte/packet bằng quy tắc phân phối lane cố định.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center justify-between&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)&quot;&gt;Thought for 28s&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; data-rtl-flip=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;icon-xs&quot;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;bd4e3576-77c8-49a6-9d4b-5d9b88d2701d&quot; data-turn-start-message=&quot;true&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1eg60nf&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;48&quot;&gt;1. IMX219 module đã có CSI-2 packetizer chưa?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;50&quot; data-end=&quot;242&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;50&quot; data-end=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Có.&lt;/strong&gt; Với camera sensor như &lt;strong data-start=&quot;80&quot; data-end=&quot;95&quot;&gt;Sony IMX219&lt;/strong&gt;, bên trong sensor đã có khối &lt;strong data-start=&quot;125&quot; data-end=&quot;146&quot;&gt;CSI-2 transmitter&lt;/strong&gt;, bao gồm phần đóng gói dữ liệu ảnh thành &lt;strong data-start=&quot;188&quot; data-end=&quot;205&quot;&gt;CSI-2 packets&lt;/strong&gt; rồi đẩy ra ngoài qua &lt;strong data-start=&quot;227&quot; data-end=&quot;241&quot;&gt;MIPI D-PHY&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;476&quot;&gt;Trong datasheet IMX219 có ghi rõ sensor hỗ trợ &lt;strong data-start=&quot;291&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;CSI-2 serial data output&lt;/strong&gt;, chọn được &lt;strong data-start=&quot;331&quot; data-end=&quot;353&quot;&gt;4-lane hoặc 2-lane&lt;/strong&gt;, có &lt;strong data-start=&quot;358&quot; data-end=&quot;389&quot;&gt;2-wire serial communication&lt;/strong&gt; để cấu hình, và tốc độ dữ liệu tối đa theo lane. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;478&quot; data-end=&quot;514&quot;&gt;Sơ đồ bên trong có thể hiểu như sau:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;516&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219 sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ Pixel array                                │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│   ↓                                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ ADC 10-bit                                 │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│   ↓                                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ Timing generator                           │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│   ↓                                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ RAW Bayer formatter                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│   ↓                                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ CSI-2 packetizer / CSI-2 TX                │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│   ↓                                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ MIPI D-PHY transmitter                     │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;└────────────────────────────────────────────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;        ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   CSI-2 lanes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1311&quot;&gt;Nên khi bạn dùng IMX219, bạn &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1208&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;không phải tự viết packetizer bên ngoài&lt;/strong&gt; nếu chỉ muốn lấy ảnh từ sensor. Sensor đã tự đóng gói kiểu:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1313&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Frame Start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Long Packet chứa RAW8/RAW10 line data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Long Packet chứa RAW8/RAW10 line data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Frame End&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1431&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1effuoo&quot; data-start=&quot;1433&quot; data-end=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;2. Có cần cấu hình lại packetizer của IMX219 không?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1538&quot;&gt;Không cấu hình packetizer như một block riêng&lt;/strong&gt;, nhưng bạn &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1550&quot; data-end=&quot;1619&quot;&gt;có cấu hình các tham số làm packetizer thay đổi cách xuất dữ liệu&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1622&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;Thông thường driver sẽ cấu hình IMX219 qua &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1672&quot;&gt;I2C&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1675&quot; data-end=&quot;1722&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU / SoC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓ I2C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219 registers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1724&quot; data-end=&quot;1756&quot;&gt;Các tham số thường cấu hình gồm:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1758&quot; data-end=&quot;1964&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Độ phân giải&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Crop/window&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Frame rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RAW8 hay RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Exposure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Analog gain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Digital gain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Test pattern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- PLL/link frequency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Số lane CSI-2 nếu phần cứng hỗ trợ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Start/stop streaming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1966&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;Linux camera stack cũng mô tả sensor driver chịu trách nhiệm cấu hình camera sensor qua I2C/SPI; với IMX219, driver hỗ trợ Bayer 8-bit và 10-bit, các control như pixel rate, blanking, exposure, gain, flip và test pattern. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2227&quot; data-end=&quot;2269&quot;&gt;Tức là bạn thường không ghi register kiểu:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2271&quot; data-end=&quot;2328&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;PACKETIZER_ENABLE = 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;PACKETIZER_MODE = RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2330&quot; data-end=&quot;2394&quot;&gt;một cách tách biệt. Thay vào đó bạn chọn &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2371&quot; data-end=&quot;2386&quot;&gt;sensor mode&lt;/strong&gt;, ví dụ:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2396&quot; data-end=&quot;2476&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;3280 × 2464 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;1920 × 1080 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;1640 × 1232 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAW8 test mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2478&quot; data-end=&quot;2520&quot;&gt;Rồi sensor tự xuất CSI-2 packet tương ứng.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2522&quot; data-end=&quot;2790&quot;&gt;Lưu ý quan trọng: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2540&quot; data-end=&quot;2588&quot;&gt;chip IMX219 có thể hỗ trợ 2-lane hoặc 4-lane&lt;/strong&gt;, nhưng &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2596&quot; data-end=&quot;2613&quot;&gt;module cụ thể&lt;/strong&gt; có thể chỉ nối ra 2 lane. Ví dụ các module kiểu Raspberry Pi Camera v2 thường dùng cấu hình 2-lane. Vì vậy không phải cứ sensor hỗ trợ 4-lane là board của bạn dùng được 4-lane.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2792&quot; data-end=&quot;2795&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;z8xw4j&quot; data-start=&quot;2797&quot; data-end=&quot;2876&quot;&gt;3. CSI-2 streaming hoạt động như thế nào để truyền frame liên tục tốc độ cao?&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2878&quot; data-end=&quot;3028&quot;&gt;CSI-2 truyền dữ liệu theo kiểu &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2909&quot; data-end=&quot;2935&quot;&gt;streaming packet-based&lt;/strong&gt;. Khi bật stream, sensor liên tục quét ảnh theo frame, theo line, rồi packetize và truyền đi.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3030&quot; data-end=&quot;3046&quot;&gt;Luồng tổng quát:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3048&quot; data-end=&quot;3190&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pixel array&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ADC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAW Bayer data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI-2 packetizer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;D-PHY HS transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI-2 Receiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP / DMA / RAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3192&quot; data-end=&quot;3227&quot;&gt;Một frame có thể hình dung như sau:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3229&quot; data-end=&quot;3446&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;FS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line 0 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line 1 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line 2 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line N RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line 0 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line 1 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3448&quot; data-end=&quot;3457&quot;&gt;Trong đó:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3459&quot; data-end=&quot;3502&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;FS = Frame Start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FE = Frame End&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3504&quot; data-end=&quot;3531&quot;&gt;Một số sensor cũng có thêm:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3533&quot; data-end=&quot;3574&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;LS = Line Start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;LE = Line End&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3576&quot; data-end=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;nhưng không phải hệ nào cũng bắt buộc dùng LS/LE rõ ràng.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3635&quot; data-end=&quot;3638&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1g5er9t&quot; data-start=&quot;3640&quot; data-end=&quot;3692&quot;&gt;4. Điều gì giúp CSI-2 truyền liên tục tốc độ cao?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3694&quot; data-end=&quot;3712&quot;&gt;Có 5 cơ chế chính.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;4jmzn5&quot; data-start=&quot;3714&quot; data-end=&quot;3764&quot;&gt;Thứ nhất: truyền nối tiếp tốc độ cao qua D-PHY&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3766&quot; data-end=&quot;3902&quot;&gt;Khi chưa truyền, lane ở trạng thái &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3801&quot; data-end=&quot;3815&quot;&gt;LP-11 idle&lt;/strong&gt;. Khi bắt đầu stream, transmitter chuyển sang &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3861&quot; data-end=&quot;3872&quot;&gt;HS mode&lt;/strong&gt; để truyền dữ liệu tốc độ cao.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3904&quot; data-end=&quot;4101&quot;&gt;Linux CSI-2 documentation mô tả transmitter nên giữ LP-11 khi powered nhưng chưa active; chỉ khi stream-on thì mới kích hoạt clock lane và chuyển sang HS mode. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4103&quot; data-end=&quot;4212&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;LP-11 idle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓ stream on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;HS mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓ truyền packet liên tục&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;LP-11 hoặc tiếp tục HS tùy mode/gap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4214&quot; data-end=&quot;4217&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1t1hzap&quot; data-start=&quot;4219&quot; data-end=&quot;4259&quot;&gt;Thứ hai: nhiều lane truyền song song&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4261&quot; data-end=&quot;4394&quot;&gt;Nếu dùng 2 lane, dữ liệu packet không phải “copy nguyên packet lên cả 2 lane”. Thay vào đó, CSI-2 chia byte của packet ra nhiều lane.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4396&quot; data-end=&quot;4421&quot;&gt;Ví dụ packet byte stream:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4423&quot; data-end=&quot;4462&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;B0 B1 B2 B3 B4 B5 B6 B7 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4464&quot; data-end=&quot;4480&quot;&gt;Với 2 data lane:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4482&quot; data-end=&quot;4547&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lane 0: B0  B2  B4  B6 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lane 1: B1  B3  B5  B7 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4549&quot; data-end=&quot;4565&quot;&gt;Với 4 data lane:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4567&quot; data-end=&quot;4690&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lane 0: B0  B4  B8  B12 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lane 1: B1  B5  B9  B13 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lane 2: B2  B6  B10 B14 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lane 3: B3  B7  B11 B15 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4692&quot; data-end=&quot;4749&quot;&gt;Nhờ vậy tổng băng thông tăng gần tuyến tính theo số lane.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4751&quot; data-end=&quot;4872&quot;&gt;Linux CSI-2 documentation đưa công thức pixel rate liên quan đến &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4816&quot; data-end=&quot;4834&quot;&gt;link frequency&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4836&quot; data-end=&quot;4847&quot;&gt;số lane&lt;/strong&gt;, và &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4852&quot; data-end=&quot;4871&quot;&gt;bits per sample&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4874&quot; data-end=&quot;4944&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;pixel_rate = link_freq × 2 × nr_of_lanes / bits_per_sample&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4946&quot; data-end=&quot;5071&quot;&gt;Trong đó hệ số &lt;code data-start=&quot;4961&quot; data-end=&quot;4964&quot;&gt;2&lt;/code&gt; là do truyền DDR, tức mỗi lane truyền hai bit trên mỗi chu kỳ clock. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;5073&quot; data-end=&quot;5076&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1ddkp5j&quot; data-start=&quot;5078&quot; data-end=&quot;5134&quot;&gt;Thứ ba: packet header cho receiver biết đang nhận gì&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5136&quot; data-end=&quot;5162&quot;&gt;Mỗi long packet có header:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;5164&quot; data-end=&quot;5210&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Data ID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Word Count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ECC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Payload&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CRC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5212&quot; data-end=&quot;5221&quot;&gt;Trong đó:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;5223&quot; data-end=&quot;5354&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Data ID = Virtual Channel + Data Type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Word Count = số byte payload&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ECC = kiểm tra lỗi header&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CRC = kiểm tra lỗi payload&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5356&quot; data-end=&quot;5385&quot;&gt;Receiver nhìn header sẽ biết:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;5387&quot; data-end=&quot;5516&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Đây là RAW10 hay RAW8/YUV/RGB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Payload dài bao nhiêu byte&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Packet thuộc virtual channel nào&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Header có lỗi không&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;5518&quot; data-end=&quot;5521&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;awnxpn&quot; data-start=&quot;5523&quot; data-end=&quot;5580&quot;&gt;Thứ tư: blanking giúp tạo khoảng nghỉ giữa line/frame&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5582&quot; data-end=&quot;5645&quot;&gt;Camera không nhất thiết truyền pixel 100% thời gian. Sensor có:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;5647&quot; data-end=&quot;5700&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Horizontal blanking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Vertical blanking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5702&quot; data-end=&quot;5798&quot;&gt;Các khoảng này giúp điều chỉnh frame rate, exposure timing, và tạo khoảng trống giữa line/frame.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5800&quot; data-end=&quot;5806&quot;&gt;Ví dụ:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;5808&quot; data-end=&quot;5916&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Frame 0 image data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Vertical blanking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Frame 1 image data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Vertical blanking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Frame 2 image data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5918&quot; data-end=&quot;6090&quot;&gt;Các control như &lt;code data-start=&quot;5934&quot; data-end=&quot;5951&quot;&gt;V4L2_CID_HBLANK&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-start=&quot;5953&quot; data-end=&quot;5970&quot;&gt;V4L2_CID_VBLANK&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-start=&quot;5972&quot; data-end=&quot;5993&quot;&gt;V4L2_CID_PIXEL_RATE&lt;/code&gt; thường được dùng để tính frame timing trong driver IMX219. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;6092&quot; data-end=&quot;6095&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1x49m0y&quot; data-start=&quot;6097&quot; data-end=&quot;6153&quot;&gt;Thứ năm: receiver được cấu hình trước để khớp sensor&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;6155&quot; data-end=&quot;6213&quot;&gt;Trước khi bật streaming, driver phải cấu hình cả hai phía:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;6215&quot; data-end=&quot;6422&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- resolution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- format RAW8/RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- lane count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- link frequency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- pixel rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI-2 Receiver:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- lane count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- D-PHY timing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- expected data type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- virtual channel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- pixel format&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- buffer/DMA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;6424&quot; data-end=&quot;6642&quot;&gt;Linux CSI-2 documentation nói transmitter driver cần cung cấp cho receiver thông tin bus configuration như &lt;code data-start=&quot;6531&quot; data-end=&quot;6542&quot;&gt;LINK_FREQ&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-start=&quot;6544&quot; data-end=&quot;6556&quot;&gt;PIXEL_RATE&lt;/code&gt;, và callback &lt;code data-start=&quot;6570&quot; data-end=&quot;6582&quot;&gt;s_stream()&lt;/code&gt; để start/stop stream. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;6644&quot; data-end=&quot;6691&quot;&gt;Nếu hai bên cấu hình không khớp, có thể xảy ra:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;6693&quot; data-end=&quot;6854&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Không lock được D-PHY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Sai data type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Sai line length&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Sai Bayer order&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- CRC/ECC error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Frame bị sọc, mất dòng, sai màu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Không có frame output&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;6856&quot; data-end=&quot;6859&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;1wqkokt&quot; data-start=&quot;6861&quot; data-end=&quot;6945&quot;&gt;5. Nếu có 2 lane cùng truyền, receiver biết thứ tự packet trước/sau bằng cách nào?&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;6947&quot; data-end=&quot;7058&quot;&gt;Điểm rất quan trọng: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;6968&quot; data-end=&quot;7057&quot;&gt;2 lane không truyền 2 packet độc lập theo kiểu lane 0 là packet A, lane 1 là packet B&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;7060&quot; data-end=&quot;7189&quot;&gt;Thông thường, một packet CSI-2 được xem là &lt;strong data-start=&quot;7103&quot; data-end=&quot;7132&quot;&gt;một chuỗi byte tuyến tính&lt;/strong&gt;, sau đó được chia đều lên các lane theo quy tắc cố định.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;7191&quot; data-end=&quot;7204&quot;&gt;Ví dụ packet:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;7206&quot; data-end=&quot;7297&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Packet = [Header][Payload][CRC]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Byte stream:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;B0 B1 B2 B3 B4 B5 B6 B7 B8 B9 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;7299&quot; data-end=&quot;7310&quot;&gt;Với 2 lane:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;7312&quot; data-end=&quot;7377&quot;&gt;&lt;div 